    "TitleKey": "Foxwell_DefendDestructibleEntites_E_Title_001",
    "DisplayTitle": "Yellow Lvl. Contract: Protect Fuel Tanks",
    "Description": "Any willing pilots in the area? Need some protection around <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> for a client. A band of outlaws has been targeting their <EM4>~mission(Objects)</EM4>, and if nothing's done about it they'll do some real damage. Need someone to protect the client\u2019s property as much as possible and deal with the thugs.\n\nFrom the intel we\u2019ve managed to gather, these thugs are small-time but can cause some pain if you\u2019re not careful. So, if you manage to nail this to the Foxwell standards, we\u2019re offering <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) MG Scrip</EM4> to the main contractor. \n\nGood luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
    "DescriptionKey": "Foxwell_DefendDestructibleEntites_E_Desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Any willing pilots in the area? Need some protection around <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> for a client. A band of outlaws has been targeting their <EM4>Fuel Tanks</EM4>, and if nothing's done about it they'll do some real damage. Need someone to protect the client\u2019s property as much as possible and deal with the thugs.\n\nFrom the intel we\u2019ve managed to gather, these thugs are small-time but can cause some pain if you\u2019re not careful. So, if you manage to nail this to the Foxwell standards, we\u2019re offering <EM4>[ScripAmount] MG Scrip</EM4> to the main contractor. \n\nGood luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
